# 20. Alur Kerja Program

Secara keseluruhan, alur program dapat digambarkan sebagai berikut:

```text
                +----------------------+
                |   PROGRAM JADWAL     |
                |       KULIAH         |
                +----------+-----------+
                           |
                    +------v------+
                    |    LOGIN     |
                    +------+-------+
                           |
                    Berhasil Login?
                     /           \
                   Tidak          Ya
                    |             |
              3 kesempatan       |
                    |             |
                    |       +-----v------+
                    |       | Cek Role   |
                    |       +-----+------+
                    |             |
              +-----v-----+       |
              |  Login    |   +--+------+
              |  gagal    |   |         |
              +-----------+  Admin     User
                              |         |
                        +-----v--+   +--v------+
                        |  Menu  |   |  Menu   |
                        | Admin  |   |  User   |
                        +--------+   +---------+
                            |            |
                     CRUD Jadwal     Lihat/Cari
                            |            |
                            +-----+------+
                                  |
                               Logout
                                  |
                           Kembali Login
```

